    "detailed_description": "Step into the exciting world of LOVE Hotel Simulator \ud83c\udfe9, a cool resource management game where you take on the role of a proud owner of your very own LOVE Hotel! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/c3dca9dc3f4a95a7eb4371b56cec2786.poster.avif?t=1755535996\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/c3dca9dc3f4a95a7eb4371b56cec2786.webm?t=1755535996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/c3dca9dc3f4a95a7eb4371b56cec2786.mp4?t=1755535996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Start from scratch, hire staff, fulfill client requests, customize rooms, and turn your business into the most elite destination in town. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/629516a69da6f4203c9f2a5690c572bf.poster.avif?t=1755535996\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/629516a69da6f4203c9f2a5690c572bf.webm?t=1755535996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/629516a69da6f4203c9f2a5690c572bf.mp4?t=1755535996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Develop your managerial skills, offer extra services, and expand your hotel to new heights. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/b020d5241220022a806f61ada74716a9.poster.avif?t=1755535996\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/b020d5241220022a806f61ada74716a9.webm?t=1755535996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/b020d5241220022a806f61ada74716a9.mp4?t=1755535996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With first-person gameplay, you'll be fully immersed in the day-to-day operations and challenges of running a successful business.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/a7d46dde9b21d6f6940f33197b5133cb.poster.avif?t=1755535996\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/a7d46dde9b21d6f6940f33197b5133cb.webm?t=1755535996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/a7d46dde9b21d6f6940f33197b5133cb.mp4?t=1755535996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features our players will love:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Customizable characters and rooms</strong>. Design unique interiors and create standout looks for your staff to attract more clients.<br></li><li><strong>Skill progression system</strong>. Level up your management abilities to take your hotel to the next level.<br></li><li><strong>Dynamic client requests.</strong> Each guest has specific preferences, making every interaction fresh and engaging.<br></li><li><strong>Realistic economy</strong>. Manage your finances carefully to maximize profits and grow your business.<br></li><li><strong>First-person immersion</strong>. Explore your hotel, interact with staff, and solve problems on the go.<br><br>Build the LOVE Hotel of your dreams and show the world you\u2019ve got what it takes to succeed!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Step into the exciting world of LOVE Hotel Simulator \ud83c\udfe9, a cool resource management game where you take on the role of a proud owner of your very own LOVE Hotel! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/c3dca9dc3f4a95a7eb4371b56cec2786.poster.avif?t=1755535996\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/c3dca9dc3f4a95a7eb4371b56cec2786.webm?t=1755535996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/c3dca9dc3f4a95a7eb4371b56cec2786.mp4?t=1755535996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Start from scratch, hire staff, fulfill client requests, customize rooms, and turn your business into the most elite destination in town. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/629516a69da6f4203c9f2a5690c572bf.poster.avif?t=1755535996\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/629516a69da6f4203c9f2a5690c572bf.webm?t=1755535996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/629516a69da6f4203c9f2a5690c572bf.mp4?t=1755535996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Develop your managerial skills, offer extra services, and expand your hotel to new heights. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/b020d5241220022a806f61ada74716a9.poster.avif?t=1755535996\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/b020d5241220022a806f61ada74716a9.webm?t=1755535996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/b020d5241220022a806f61ada74716a9.mp4?t=1755535996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With first-person gameplay, you'll be fully immersed in the day-to-day operations and challenges of running a successful business.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/a7d46dde9b21d6f6940f33197b5133cb.poster.avif?t=1755535996\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/a7d46dde9b21d6f6940f33197b5133cb.webm?t=1755535996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426430/extras/a7d46dde9b21d6f6940f33197b5133cb.mp4?t=1755535996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features our players will love:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Customizable characters and rooms</strong>. Design unique interiors and create standout looks for your staff to attract more clients.<br></li><li><strong>Skill progression system</strong>. Level up your management abilities to take your hotel to the next level.<br></li><li><strong>Dynamic client requests.</strong> Each guest has specific preferences, making every interaction fresh and engaging.<br></li><li><strong>Realistic economy</strong>. Manage your finances carefully to maximize profits and grow your business.<br></li><li><strong>First-person immersion</strong>. Explore your hotel, interact with staff, and solve problems on the go.<br><br>Build the LOVE Hotel of your dreams and show the world you\u2019ve got what it takes to succeed!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "LOVE Hotel Simulator \ud83c\udfe9 is a fun resource management game where you build your LOVE Hotel from the ground up! Hire staff, satisfy clients, customize rooms, expand your business, and level up your managerial skills. Immerse yourself with first-person gameplay!",
